# SPA fallback for the routes that are NOT prerendered (/:lang/benefits, /:lang/start/*).
# Status 200 (a rewrite, not a redirect) so the URL is preserved.
#
# Both Cloudflare Pages and Netlify resolve a real static file BEFORE consulting this rule,
# so the 92 prerendered pages are served as themselves and are never shadowed by the SPA
# shell. Do not add `force` / `!` here — that is precisely what would shadow them and quietly
# destroy the SEO the prerendering exists for.
/*  /index.html  200
